n $45.4B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +12% over the past three years and +12% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Gross margins of 12% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The company is burning through $636M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 4.1\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 9.2% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Accruals running hot at +6.5% of assets \u2014 earnings quality bears watching","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.5% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $3.9M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Healthcare peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 35% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Among the least levered in Healthcare \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Molina Healthcare (NYSE:MOH) Director Sells 1,600 Shares of Stock","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/molina-healthcare-nysemoh-director-sells-1600-shares-of-stock.html","date":"2026-11-14","timestamp":1794614964.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.919,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Price-Driven Insight from (MOH) for Rule-Based Strategy","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/15/Price-Driven_Insight_from_MOH_for_Rule-Based_Strategy_111226013602_1794508562.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794508562.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Molina Healthcare (MOH) Looks Fairly Valued On Its 2027 Earnings Framework","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nyse-moh/molina-healthcare/news/molina-healthcare-moh-looks-fairly-valued-on-its-2027-earnin","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794454207.283,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.902,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Head to H